iv class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">9.40<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">December 14, 2011<br/>Winter Update 2011</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20171006134318&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Ice_Flower_Seeds_15b248.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see  ice flower seeds.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 0.50 oz.</div><div class=\"p-flavortext\">They seem to have strange effects on other plants and can also be grown into an own plant.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Obtained by using <a href=\"#/wiki/Ice%20Flower\">Ice Flowers</a> during the <a href=\"#/quest/thawing-mini-world-change\">Thawing Mini World Change</a>. It can be planted in an Empty Flower Pot which will grow into a Winterblossom Flower.\n<span style=\"line-height: 20px; margin-top: 13px;\"><i> <b>See also:</b> Ice Flower/Harvesting Statistics </i> </span>When you use the ice flower seeds on any fully grown plant it will never need to be watered again. Also the first time you combine the ice seeds with a fully grown plant you will earn the Achievement Preservationist.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"creature-list-generic no-